@startuml
title CRC check flow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Sender has payload bytes;
:Calculate CRC with agreed parameters;
:Append CRC to the payload;
:Transmit or store the frame;
:Receiver reads payload and received CRC;
:Recalculate CRC on received payload;
if (CRC values match?) then (yes)
  :Accept payload as apparently intact;
else (no)
  :Reject payload or request retry;
endif
stop

@enduml
